WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.606
The pyramid tarot spread builds from a base of
three cards to a single card at the top.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:09.153
It suits questions about what to do next.

00:00:10.453 --> 00:00:11.568
The six positions.

00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:15.097
Read the base row first, left to right,
then work upward.

00:00:16.397 --> 00:00:17.647
How to lay it out.

00:00:17.647 --> 00:00:23.409
Place cards 1, 2 and 3 in a row along the
bottom, with a little space between them.

00:00:24.809 --> 00:00:27.248
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:27.248 --> 00:00:32.193
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
